WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Luke blocks Ryu’s recorded Drive Reversal.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.650
Crouching medium punch catches the recovery as Punish Counter.

3
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.450
Standing light punch links into Triple Impact.

4
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:03.150
The heavy target hit launches Ryu.

5
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.850
Heavy Flash Knuckle finishes the punish.
